Conclusion
The hardest part of workout and meal planning app development is not writing CRUD endpoints. It is preserving meaning across mutable plans, historical activity, nutritional estimates, and user-specific permissions. A strong first version uses explicit entities, database constraints, transaction-safe writes, stable API contracts, and repeatable tests. Build that foundation before adding advanced analytics, AI, or distributed infrastructure.
